  "body_html": "<h1>Basic Auction Formats</h1>\n<p>The basic auction layer defines single-item and multi-item transfer-auction\nformats. Multi-item feasibility records that no item is allocated to two\ndistinct agents.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[Krishna, Chapters 2-3] Vijay Krishna, <em>Auction Theory</em>, 2nd ed.,\n  <code>references/AuctionTheory.pdf</code>. Standard sealed-bid auction formats and\n  private-value auction models.</li>\n<li>[AGT, Chapter 1, Section 1.3.2] Nisan, Roughgarden, Tardos, and Vazirani,\n  <em>Algorithmic Game Theory</em>, <code>references/AlgorithmicGameTheory.pdf</code>.\n  First-price and second-price sealed-bid auctions as basic algorithmic game\n  theory examples.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Migrated from EconCSLib pull request 27, old blueprint label\n  <code>def:auction_basic_formats</code> in <code>blueprint/src/content.tex</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
